Multi-table ZIP and PBO resources require \code{table_id}; Finance workbooks use
\code{sheet} (defaulting to the release fiscal year).  The parser fails closed on
unsupported media, malformed schema, duplicate natural keys, unit or
status drift, unsafe archive members, partial responses and pinned hash
