\code{readfiscalau_provenance$raw_bytes}; path-based workbook, DOCX and ZIP reads
retain their verified \code{readfiscalau_provenance$raw_snapshot_path} and set
\code{readfiscalau_provenance$raw_bytes} to an empty raw vector.  The reader
writes only to \code{cache_dir} and temporary directories; it never writes to
the working directory or downloads credentials.  Finance June releases
must be read as FBO or CFS, never as a monthly statement.
